# Boundary guard: Unknown-typed value from from-json passed to Int parameter.
# The type checker (CALL-MONO path) records a boundary guard because from-json
# returns Unknown and the function expects Int. At eval time, from-json "\"hello\""
# evaluates to String "hello", which fails the Int guard.
[call [fn [x@Int] x] [from-json "\"hello\""]]
=== error
[E011] type assertion failed: expected Int, got String
